url: "https://au-cbgm-shiny.augusta.edu/cellivista/"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21708160"

abstract: >-
  Cellivista is an open-source R/Shiny application for end-to-end
  single-cell RNA-seq analysis, including data import, quality control,
  filtering, doublet detection, sample integration, clustering,
  differential expression analysis, cell-type annotation, and
  publication-quality visualization using established Seurat-based workflows.

keywords:
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - scRNA-seq
  - Shiny
  - Seurat
  - bioinformatics

